OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Greens call on Swinney to
OL,4,Astop 'swithering' on oil and gas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leaders of the Scottish Green Party
OL,7,Fhave condemned the UK and Scottish
OL,8,Fgovernment's positions on new oil and
OL,9,Fgas drilling.
OL,11,FSpeaking at the party's conference in
OL,12,FInverness, co-leader Gillian Mackay
OL,13,Fcriticised Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,14,Ffor approving production at the Jackdaw
OL,15,Fgas field and accused John Swinney of
OL,16,F"years of swithering".
OL,18,FRoss Greer, the other party leader,
OL,19,Fsaid Scotland had bragging rights to
OL,20,Fthe "most successful Green party in the
OL,21,Fworld" by homing in on "what people
OL,22,Fneed to hear".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
