OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Greens call on Swinney to
OL,4,Astop 'swithering' on oil and gas
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe used his platform to announce a new
OL,7,Ftax on flights to pay for a "millennial
OL,8,Frailcard" that would allow people in
OL,9,Ftheir 30s and 40s to get a third off
OL,10,Ftrain fares.
